stic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibility(removeTraits:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibility(removeTraits:)","abstract":[],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibility"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"removeTraits"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI19AccessibilityTraitsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityTraits"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(removetraits:)","title":"accessibility(removeTraits:)","role":"symbol","depr